# Private keys, credentials and device identity.
# Never commit these to source or to the wiki. A key that reaches history
# stays in history: rotate it rather than relying on a later deletion.
*.key
telemetry.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.csr
*.pfx
*.p12
*.token
